        "description": "Paddle Lite is a high-performance, lightweight, highly flexible, and easily extensible deep learning inference framework, positioned to support multiple hardware platforms including mobile, embedded, and edge devices. Currently, Paddle Lite is not only comprehensively applied in Baidu's internal business but also successfully supports numerous external users and enterprise production tasks.",
